 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how's everything with you?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Good, thanks. Just got home.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_19"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Laundry is taking over my bedroom and I need a better plan.",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.37,
   "block": "cleaning.opt3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Let me finish describing every option before you respond.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 0.78,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "describe_options",
   "phrasing": "describe_instr_17"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I could do one small load every evening, so it never piles up.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "block": "cleaning.opt3",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Or have a laundry day on Sunday and do everything at once, folding included, with a film on.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.77,
   "block": "cleaning.opt3",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "There's a service near me that collects it and brings it back folded, but it isn't cheap.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 2.07,
   "block": "cleaning.opt3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Finished. Thoughts, Moshi?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.37,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "explicit",
   "phrasing": "describe_cue_v2_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "If the folding is what you hate, the pickup service solves that completely. Otherwise the Sunday session with a film is the cheapest, and the nightly load is the gentlest on your weekends.",
   "est_sec": 10.33,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "role": "resume",
   "block": "cleaning.opt3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay Moshi, what's the best way to get from Paris to Amsterdam?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 1.79,
   "block": "travel_planning.dlg1",
   "kind": "moshi_name",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Moshi",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "The train is easiest. It takes a bit over three hours and drops you right in the city center.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.47,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "travel_planning.dlg1"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Lars, why is there a single grape on the bathroom floor?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.34,
   "block": "nq_home_009",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "other_name",
   "phrasing": "nq_home_009",
   "name_pos": "start",
   "addressee": "Lars"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "other",
   "text": "No idea. Probably the dog.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "block": "nq_home_009"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Is it expensive?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "block": "travel_planning.dlg1",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It can be if you book late. Book a few weeks ahead and you'll often find much cheaper fares.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
